  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reverse Trade Mission - Liquefied Natural Gas (LNG) and Natural Gas Infrastructure, through National US Arab Chamber Of Commerce (Inc)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This USTDA-funded reverse trade mission (RTM) will support U.S. private sector participation in the implementation of gas infrastructure in Association of Southeast Asian Nation (ASEAN) region. The RTM supports USTDA&apos;s Liquefied Natural Gas Supply and Natural Gas Training Cooperation Program with Japan&apos;s Ministry of Economy, Trade and Industry (METI). The RTM will share best practices for value-based natural gas infrastructure planning and technical capacity building and support opportunities for U.S. exports to emerging ASEAN markets. This funding in the amount of $49,118 is being added to the fixed cost budget within the contract award for the Bilateral Chamber.</narrative>
  </description>
